    <h1>About URLshortner</h1>

    <h2>Simplify. Shorten. Track.</h2>

    <p>
        Welcome to <strong>URLshortner</strong>, a smart and efficient URL management platform designed to make sharing links easier, faster, and more convenient. Long and complicated URLs can be difficult to share, remember, and manage. URLshortner solves this problem by transforming lengthy URLs into short, clean, and easy-to-share links.
    </p>

    <h2>What We Offer</h2>

    <p>
        URLshortner provides a complete solution for managing shortened URLs. Users can create short and unique links, generate QR codes for easy sharing, and monitor link performance through detailed click analytics. The platform also offers expiry management, allowing users to control the validity of their links, along with a centralized dashboard where they can search, view, and manage all their URLs conveniently.
    </p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>

    <p>
        Our mission is to make link sharing simple, efficient, and reliable. We aim to provide users with an easy-to-use platform that not only simplifies URLs but also helps them understand visitor activity and gain useful insights into how their links perform.
    </p>

    <h2>Built With Technology</h2>

    <p>
        URLshortner is developed using modern web technologies, including Node.js, Express.js, EJS, MySQL, and Prisma ORM. These technologies work together to provide a smooth user experience, reliable data management, and efficient backend functionality.
    </p>

    <p class="about-tagline">
        <strong>Shorten your links. Understand your audience. Share smarter.</strong>
    </p>

    <p>Thank you for choosing URLshortner!</p>

